{
  "key": 20259,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0564_T23_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Ilex Forest Ahead\n",
        "Enter through the gate."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0564_T23_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...Tell me something.\r",
        "Is it true that Team Rocket has\n",
        "returned?\r",
        "What? You beat them? Hah!\n",
        "Quit lying.\r",
        "Are you serious?\n",
        "Then let’s see how good you are.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0564_T23_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: I hate the weak.\r",
        "Pokémon, Trainers.\n",
        "It doesn’t matter who or what.\r",
        "I hate to see them hanging around.\n",
        "That goes for Team Rocket, too.\r",
        "They think they are big and tough\n",
        "as long as they are in a group.\r",
        "But get them alone, and they’re weak.\n",
        "I hate them all.\r",
        "You stay out of my way.\n",
        "You won’t be an exception\f",
        "if you get in my way.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0564_T23_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Nothing is going on.\n",
        "It’s unsafe to go in there, so I’m\f",
        "standing guard to make sure\f",
        "people don’t wander in.\r",
        "Am I not a good Samaritan?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0564_T23_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you know about SlowpokeTail?\n",
        "I heard it’s tasty!\r",
        "Aren’t you glad I told you that?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0564_T23_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "The Slowpoke have disappeared\n",
        "from town...\r",
        "I heard their tails are being sold\n",
        "somewhere."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0564_T23_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "The Slowpoke have returned.\r",
        "Knowing them, they could’ve just been\n",
        "taking it easy soMewhere."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0564_T23_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Did you come to get Kurt to make\n",
        "some Poké Balls?\f",
        "A lot of people do just that."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0564_T23_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Cut through Azalea and you’ll be in\n",
        "Ilex Forest.\r",
        "But these skinny trees make it\n",
        "impossible to get through.\r",
        "The Charcoal Man’s Pokémon can cut\n",
        "down trees."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0564_T23_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Slowpoke: ...\r",
        "...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0564_T23_00010",
      "en_US": "...Yawn?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0564_T23_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Azalea Town\n",
        "Living Happily with Pokémon"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0564_T23_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Kurt’s House\r",
        "Apricorn and Nothing Else\n",
        "The Stubborn Poké Ball Creator"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0564_T23_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Azalea Town Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Bugsy\f",
        "The Walking Bug Pokémon Encyclopedia"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0564_T23_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Slowpoke Well\n",
        "Also known as the Rainmaker Well.\r",
        "Locals believe that a Slowpoke’s\n",
        "yawn summons the rain.\r",
        "Records show that a Slowpoke’s yawn\n",
        "ended a drought 400 years ago.\r",
        "People also report seeing a mysterious\n",
        "purple Pokémon erupting from a stone."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0564_T23_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Charcoal Kiln\r",
        "We let our Farfetch’d fetch branches\n",
        "for charcoal!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0564_T23_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Who are you?\n",
        "You don’t know us?\r",
        "We are...\n",
        "Team Rocket!\r",
        "...What?\n",
        "We broke up a while ago?\r",
        "Give me a break!\n",
        "We have not broken up!\r",
        "Actually we did once.\n",
        "But we have come back to\f",
        "pursue Giovanni’s ambition.\r",
        "Enough talking.\n",
        "Shut up and just beat it!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0564_T23_00017",
      "en_US": "{SIZE 200}Thud!{SIZE 100}\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0564_T23_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "We have this tough guy called Kurt\n",
        "in this town.\f",
        "He should be able to take care of it..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0564_T23_00019",
      "en_US": "I knew we could count on Kurt!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0564_T23_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to throw the\n",
        "Odd Keystone into the well? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0564_T23_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} threw the Odd Keystone\n",
        "into the well.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0564_T23_00022",
      "en_US": [
        "The Spiritomb calmed down and\n",
        "retreated into the well’s depths..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0564_T23_00023",
      "en_US": "Yulaaah!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0564_T23_00024",
      "en_US": [
        "Huh! You found me! Darn!\r",
        "Just kidding! I used to be a thief,\n",
        "but then I...\r",
        "No, no way am I saying that!\r",
        "But, kid, thievery isn’t always bad.\n",
        "I’ll let you prove it with this!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0564_T23_00025",
      "en_US": [
        "Thief will allow you to steal an\n",
        "item from your opponent.\r",
        "Although, they must be holding one,\n",
        "and your Pokémon must not!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
